<title>FRANCE: Algeria's drilling firm made profit.</title>
<headline>Algeria's drilling firm made profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's state-firm Foremhyd, which specialises in hydrologic drilling, made a 16.3 million dinars ($291,070) profit in 1996, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 150 million dinars ($2.7 million)-capital Foremhyd posted a turnover of 2.9 billion dinars ($51.9 million) in 1996, said APS without giving comparative figures. ($1=56 dinars)</p>
</text>
